{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>נשבע, בגאון יעקב</b> — It is the honored Name that the nations did not know, only Jacob. And Yefet said: it concerns the ark, <b>גאון עזכם</b>, and He will give his strength to captivity."], :book :amos, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {0 "Identified Yefet as Yefet ben Eli; <b>גאון עזכם</b> kept in Hebrew as Ibn Ezra quotes it in Hebrew script from his source. The phrase alludes to Psalms 78:61."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Amos -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/amos"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:18:34.419372879Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}